<title>CROATIA: Croatian April trade gap shrinks, Jan-Apr widens.</title>
<headline>Croatian April trade gap shrinks, Jan-Apr widens.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA MERCHANDISE TRADE   APRIL  MARCH  JAN-APR  JAN-APR'96</p>
<p> Balance (million USD)	 -306   -330   -1,151	-895</p>
<p> Exports			    329    339    1,525     1,435</p>
<p> Imports			    635    669    2,676     2,330</p>
<p>NOTE -- Jan-April exports rose 6.2 percent compared to a year ago but imports rose 14.8 percent in the same period. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
